,"signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1794857332345036944,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"946f4eeb-3168-44fd-837e-b1385f2b8a5f","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"17e5-d776-31b8-40ba"},{"link_uuid":"a66e734d-3084-4b74-a657-32c24b8f9795","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"aff9-1252-ad21-4695"}],"description":"## Symptom\n\nOn 2026-11-16 (PST), `review_plan_start(sarcastic-specified-kodiakbear)` returned job `1794856602730588534-4009502f517c4b95a7044e9ac59e83ff` at 11:16 PST. The production MCP container logged `GATE_PEAK_RSS ... \"ticket_id\": \"sarcastic-specified-kodiakbear\", \"elapsed_ms\": 449638` at 1794857071 (about 11:24 PST), and `plan_review_status` reported `certified` (`signed_at` 1794857058838360399, `verified_at_sha` b4e0d01b649). Yet `gate_status(job_id)` kept returning `status: \"running\"`, `durable.verdict: \"unsigned\"` (reason \"ticket has no signature\") and `findings.readable: false, reason: run-running` on 13 polls over roughly 60 minutes, including polls made after the attestation existed.\n\n## Impact\n\nA caller that follows the documented poll protocol (wait for `gate_status` to reach `passed`/`failed`) waits indefinitely on a finished, already-signed review. This run's wait was about 60 minutes. Only `plan_review_status` showed the truth. The `durable` block inside `gate_status` also contradicted `plan_review_status` for the same ticket at the same time.\n\n## Evidence not yet gathered\n\nWhether the job-index record was never written, or was written but not read back (for example, an index held per worker or per container), has not been checked. The container was `rebar-mcp-b4e0d01b6491-8092`, up 2 days, with no blue-green flip during the run.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Root cause identified and recorded on this ticket.\n- [ ] After a plan review signs, `gate_status(job_id)` reports a terminal status and a `durable` block that agrees with `plan_review_status`; a regression test covers the failing path.\n","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","17e5-d776-31b8-40ba"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"2846-ec55-c258-4e2c","ticket_type":"bug","title":"gate_status stays \"running\" for an hour after the plan review signed its attestation","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["6f9617f5-383c-40b1-8387-0451aa44cf85","946f4eeb-3168-44fd-837e-b1385f2b8a5f","a66e734d-3084-4b74-a657-32c24b8f9795"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794857468990626334,"uuid":"9740fefd-4219-424c-b55a-6cc66f8aed51"}
